==English==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|en|poly|peptide}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|organic chemistry}} Any [[polymer]] of (same or different) [[amino acid]]s joined via [[peptide bond]]s.
# {{lb|en|biochemistry}} Any such polymer that is not [[folded]] into a [[secondary structure]] of a [[protein]].
# {{lb|en|protein}} A small [[protein]] containing up to 100 [[amino acid]]s; see also [[oligopeptide]].

====Derived terms====
* [[lipopolypeptide]]

